OL,3,GNEWSAFake bomb maker wanted 'invaders
OL,4,Ato go boom'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who made a fake nail bomb and
OL,7,Ftold police he wanted "invaders" to "go
OL,8,Fboom" has been jailed for a year.
OL,10,FSean McCrystal, 61, showed his
OL,11,F"amateur" homemade invention to
OL,12,Fofficers when they went to his house in
OL,13,FMarch, after he had sent police a
OL,14,Fseries of alarming social media
OL,15,Fmessages, Newcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FThe court was told he was frustrated
OL,18,Fdue to his belief that immigrants were
OL,19,Fgetting help and benefits he felt he
OL,20,Fshould have received.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
