OL,3,GNEWSAFake bomb maker wanted 'invaders
OL,4,Ato go boom'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcCrystal, from Gateshead, who had a
OL,7,Fdependency on alcohol according to his
OL,8,Fdefence team, admitted communicating
OL,9,Ffalse information with intent to cause
OL,10,Ffear.
